---
// Features.astro - 100% estático con Tailwind CSS v4
---

<section id="filosofia" class="features-section w-full border-t border-[var(--border-subtle)] pt-14 pb-16 md:pt-16 md:pb-24">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head max-w-[680px] mb-10">
      <span class="section-tag inline-block text-[0.78rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-[var(--accent)] mb-2.5">
        Filosofía
      </span>
      <h2 class="section-title text-[clamp(1.55rem,3vw,2.4rem)] font-bold tracking-tight">
        Diseñado para la concentración
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      {/* 1. Almacenamiento Local Directo */}
      <div class="feature-card flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-5 sm:p-7 md:p-8">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 mb-5.5 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] text-[var(--accent)] flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center">
          <svg
            width="20"
            height="20"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.75"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M22 19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h5l2 3h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[1.15rem] font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Almacenamiento Local Directo</h3>
        <p class="text-[0.96rem] leading-[1.7] text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3.5">
          Tus documentos se guardan en tu equipo en Markdown (.md). Sin formatos cerrados ni bases de datos.
        </p>
        <div class="inline-block self-start font-mono text-[0.85rem] text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold rounded-md border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--code-bg)] px-2 py-1 mt-auto break-words">
          ~/Documents/lyra/
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 2. Privacidad Total */}
      <div class="feature-card flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-5 sm:p-7 md:p-8">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 mb-5.5 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] text-[var(--accent)] flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center">
          <svg
            width="20"
            height="20"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.75"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
            <path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[1.15rem] font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Privacidad Total</h3>
        <p class="text-[0.96rem] leading-[1.7] text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3.5">
          Sin telemetría, analíticas ni cuentas de usuario. Funciona 100% fuera de línea.
        </p>
        <div class="inline-block self-start font-mono text-[0.85rem] text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold rounded-md border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--code-bg)] px-2 py-1 mt-auto break-words">
          100% sin conexión
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 3. Interfaz Auto-ocultable */}
      <div class="feature-card flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-5 sm:p-7 md:p-8">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 mb-5.5 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] text-[var(--accent)] flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center">
          <svg
            width="20"
            height="20"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.75"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
            <line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"></line>
            <line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[1.15rem] font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Interfaz Auto-ocultable</h3>
        <p class="text-[0.96rem] leading-[1.7] text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3.5">
          La interfaz desaparece mientras tecleas. Quedan solo tus palabras y tu concentración.
        </p>
        <div class="inline-block self-start font-mono text-[0.85rem] text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold rounded-md border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--code-bg)] px-2 py-1 mt-auto break-words">
          Modo zen
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 4. Rendimiento Nativo */}
      <div class="feature-card flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-5 sm:p-7 md:p-8">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 mb-5.5 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] text-[var(--accent)] flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center">
          <svg
            width="20"
            height="20"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.75"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[1.15rem] font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Rendimiento Nativo</h3>
        <p class="text-[0.96rem] leading-[1.7] text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3.5">
          Construido con Tauri y Rust. Arranque instantáneo y consumo mínimo de recursos.
        </p>
        <div class="inline-block self-start font-mono text-[0.85rem] text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold rounded-md border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--code-bg)] px-2 py-1 mt-auto break-words">
          Ligero y nativo
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 5. Tipografía iA Writer Duo */}
      <div class="feature-card flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-5 sm:p-7 md:p-8">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 mb-5.5 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] text-[var(--accent)] flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center">
          <svg
            width="20"
            height="20"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.75"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <polyline points="4 7 4 4 20 4 20 7"></polyline>
            <line x1="9" y1="20" x2="15" y2="20"></line>
            <line x1="12" y1="4" x2="12" y2="20"></line>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[1.15rem] font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Tipografía iA Writer Duo</h3>
        <p class="text-[0.96rem] leading-[1.7] text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3.5">
          Tipografía dúo-espaciada de referencia diseñada para la lectura y escritura editorial.
        </p>
        <div class="inline-block self-start font-mono text-[0.85rem] text-[var(--accent)] font-semibold rounded-md border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--code-bg)] px-2 py-1 mt-auto break-words">
          iA Writer Duo
        </div>
      </div>

      {/* 6. Software Libre */}
      <div class="feature-card flex flex-col rounded-xl border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-5 sm:p-7 md:p-8">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 mb-5.5 rounded-lg border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] text-[var(--accent)] flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center">
          <svg
            width="20"
            height="20"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.75"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M16 18l6-6-6-6"></path>
            <path d="M8 6l-6 6 6 6"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-[1.15rem] font-bold tracking-tight mb-3">Software Libre</h3>
        <p class="text-[0.96rem] leading-[1.7] text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-3.5">
          Publicado bajo{" "}
          <a
            href="https://unlicense.org"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="text-[var(--accent)] underline underline-offset-3 hover:text-[var(--accent-hover)] transition-colors"
          >
            The Unlicense
          </a>{" "}
          (dominio público). Código abierto y auditable en GitHub.
        </p>
        <div class="inline-block self-start font-mono font-semibold rounded-md border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--code-bg)] px-2 py-1 mt-auto break-words">
          <a
            href="https://unlicense.org"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="hover:text-[var(--accent-hover)] transition-colors"
          >
            The Unlicense · GitHub
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Destacado de Sincronización Opcional con Google Drive */}
    <div class="cloud-sync-callout mt-12 rounded-[14px] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-card)] p-5 sm:p-7 md:p-9 flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-5 md:gap-7 items-start">
      <div class="shrink-0">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-[10px] border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--bg-secondary)] text-[var(--accent)] flex items-center justify-center">
          <svg
            width="24"
            height="24"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.8"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            aria-hidden="true"
          >
            <path d="M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z"></path>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 flex-wrap mb-2.5">
          <span class="rounded-md bg-[var(--selection-bg)] text-[var(--accent)] text-[0.72rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2 py-1">
            Opcional
          </span>
          <span class="rounded border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--code-bg)] text-[var(--text-primary)] font-mono text-[0.8rem] font-semibold px-2 py-0.5">
            Scope: drive.file
          </span>
          <span class="text-[var(--text-primary)] text-[0.82rem] font-medium">
            Sin servidores intermedios
          </span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-[var(--text-primary)] mb-2.5">
          Sincronización opcional con Google Drive
        </h3>
        <p class="text-[1.02rem] text-[var(--text-primary)] leading-[1.65]">
          Respalda y sincroniza tus notas entre dispositivos mediante Google Drive. Conexión directa cliente-Google bajo el permiso de menor privilegio <code class="font-mono text-[0.85rem] font-semibold px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded border border-[var(--border-subtle)] bg-[var(--code-bg)] text-[var(--accent)]">https://www.googleapis.com/auth/drive.file</code>, sin servidores intermedios de Lyra ni recolección de datos.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-3">
          <a
            href="/privacy"
            class="text-[0.88rem] text-[var(--accent)] underline underline-offset-3 hover:text-[var(--accent-hover)] transition-colors"
          >
            Política de Privacidad →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
